---
---

<section id="about" class="border-t border-pine/10 bg-cream">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1440px] px-6 py-20 md:px-16 md:py-[120px]">
    <!-- Head -->
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-8 md:flex-row md:items-start md:justify-between md:gap-20">
      <div class="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-[14px] md:pt-[14px]">
        <span class="h-px w-[28px] bg-clay"></span>
        <span class="text-[13px] font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] text-[#7E8C84]">ABOUT THE CLUB</span>
      </div>
      <p class="max-w-[880px] font-display text-[30px] leading-[1.25] tracking-[-0.015em] text-[#1B1C18] sm:text-[38px] md:text-[46px] md:leading-[58px]">
        Clay rewards patience. It slows the ball, lengthens the rally, and asks you to build a point
        instead of ending it. We brought that game to Arusha.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Body -->
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-12 pt-14 md:flex-row md:gap-16 md:pt-[90px]">
      <!-- Court photo -->
      <div class="relative aspect-[760/470] w-full shrink-0 overflow-clip rounded-[10px] bg-clay md:aspect-auto md:h-[470px] md:w-[760px]">
        <img
          src="/images/about-sweeping.jpg"
          alt="Groundskeeper sweeping the white lines on a freshly groomed clay tennis court"
          class="h-full w-full object-cover"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>

      <!-- Copy + stats -->
      <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col justify-between gap-10 py-1.5">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-[26px]">
          <p class="text-[17px] leading-[29px] text-[#3C3F38]">
            Meru Clay is a private tennis club at the foot of Mount Meru, just outside Arusha. Two
            championship clay courts, hand-laid from crushed brick and watered twice daily, give you
            the genuine European clay experience at altitude.
          </p>
          <p class="text-[17px] leading-[29px] text-[#3C3F38]">
            Whether you grew up on hard courts or have never picked up a racquet, the clay is
            forgiving on the knees and unforgiving on the ego. Come learn the surface the pros fear
            most.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-12 border-t border-pine/10 pt-[34px]">
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-[5px]">
            <span class="font-display text-[24px] font-medium leading-[30px] text-[#1B1C18]">Crushed brick</span>
            <span class="text-[12px] font-medium tracking-[0.14em] text-[#7E8C84]">SURFACE</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-[5px]">
            <span class="font-display text-[24px] font-medium leading-[30px] text-[#1B1C18]">Members + guests</span>
            <span class="text-[12px] font-medium tracking-[0.14em] text-[#7E8C84]">ACCESS</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
